{"id":"n67065-2-7","stage":5,"title":"뒤틀리다 · 被搅和","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67065-2-7-1","ko":"태풍 때문에 여름 휴가 계획이 뒤틀렸으니 어쩌지?","zh":"台风打乱了夏季休假计划，怎么办？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"태풍","meaning":"台风","explanation":"태풍：台风","readings":[{"term":"태풍","audio":"/audio/1d1d0a3fd2bb06745f7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72181","senseId":"1","lemma":"태풍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"태풍","audio":"/audio/1d1d0a3fd2bb06745f7b.mp3"}},{"text":"때문에","meaning":"因为，由于","explanation":"때문：因为，由于；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"때문","audio":"/audio/e7ce9cf0ec012e05cb2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64555","senseId":"1","lemma":"때문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때문에","audio":"/audio/870904a840bc33218066.mp3"}},{"text":"여름","meaning":"夏，夏天，夏季","explanation":"여름：夏，夏天，夏季","readings":[{"term":"여름","audio":"/audio/4442e49ca3d7c1ba77c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67701","senseId":"1","lemma":"여름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여름","audio":"/audio/4442e49ca3d7c1ba77c7.mp3"}},{"text":"휴가","meaning":"休假，度假，放假，假期","explanation":"휴가：休假，度假，放假，假期","readings":[{"term":"휴가","audio":"/audio/9e9f8123891fae1cf99f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73251","senseId":"1","lemma":"휴가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"휴가","audio":"/audio/9e9f8123891fae1cf99f.mp3"}},{"text":"계획이","meaning":"计划，筹划","explanation":"계획：计划，筹划；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"계획","audio":"/audio/b0fe4ea3ac5ac4022d19.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23324","senseId":"1","lemma":"계획","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계획이","audio":"/audio/63460616ff640ce20464.mp3"}},{"text":"뒤틀렸으니","meaning":"被搅和，被妨碍，被阻碍","explanation":"뒤틀리다：被搅和，被妨碍，被阻碍；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"뒤틀리다","audio":"/audio/51e0846f6a52421526f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67065","senseId":"2","lemma":"뒤틀리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뒤틀렸으니","audio":"/audio/130f69726704bb1db0e2.mp3"}},{"text":"어쩌지?","meaning":"“어찌하다(怎么会)”的缩略语。","explanation":"어쩌다：“어찌하다(怎么会)”的缩略语。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"어쩌다","audio":"/audio/85a8c2b5d5fccc03afbb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91975","senseId":"1","lemma":"어쩌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어쩌지","audio":"/audio/e458e74417e5e016790e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1d1d0a3fd2bb0674","term":"태풍","zh":"台风","audio":"/audio/1d1d0a3fd2bb06745f7b.mp3","entryId":"72181","definition":"主要指在7~9月，从太平洋刮到韩国、日本等亚洲大陆东部地区的伴随暴雨的狂风。","pronunciation":["태풍"]},{"id":"e7ce9cf0ec012e05","term":"때문","zh":"因为，由于","audio":"/audio/e7ce9cf0ec012e05cb2b.mp3","entryId":"64555","definition":"表示原因或理由。","pronunciation":["때문"]},{"id":"4442e49ca3d7c1ba","term":"여름","zh":"夏，夏天，夏季","audio":"/audio/4442e49ca3d7c1ba77c7.mp3","entryId":"67701","definition":"四季之一，介于春秋之间的季节。","pronunciation":["여름"]},{"id":"9e9f8123891fae1c","term":"휴가","zh":"休假，度假，放假，假期","audio":"/audio/9e9f8123891fae1cf99f.mp3","entryId":"73251","definition":"属于工作单位或军队等团体的人在一定期间内从岗位上脱离出来并休息；或指这种时间。","pronunciation":["휴가"]},{"id":"b0fe4ea3ac5ac402","term":"계획","zh":"计划，筹划","audio":"/audio/b0fe4ea3ac5ac4022d19.mp3","entryId":"23324","definition":"仔细考虑并决定将来的事情。","pronunciation":["계ː획","게ː훽"]},{"id":"51e0846f6a524215","term":"뒤틀리다","zh":"被搅和，被妨碍，被阻碍","audio":"/audio/51e0846f6a52421526f8.mp3","entryId":"67065","definition":"事情无法顺利进行。","pronunciation":["뒤틀리다"]},{"id":"85a8c2b5d5fccc03","term":"어쩌다","zh":"“어찌하다(怎么会)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/85a8c2b5d5fccc03afbb.mp3","entryId":"91975","definition":"“어찌하다(怎么会)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]}],"audio":"/audio/ef31599eeffe4d6f2913.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67065-2-7-2","ko":"여행은 다음 휴가 때로 미뤄야지 뭐.","zh":"只好把旅行推到下次假期了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여행은","meaning":"旅行，旅游","explanation":"여행：旅行，旅游；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"여행","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28026","senseId":"1","lemma":"여행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여행은","audio":"/audio/2553e8b91fd4286cb4b1.mp3"}},{"text":"다음","meaning":"以后，下次","explanation":"다음：以后，下次","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"5","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}},{"text":"휴가","meaning":"休假，度假，放假，假期","explanation":"휴가：休假，度假，放假，假期","readings":[{"term":"휴가","audio":"/audio/9e9f8123891fae1cf99f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73251","senseId":"1","lemma":"휴가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"휴가","audio":"/audio/9e9f8123891fae1cf99f.mp3"}},{"text":"때로","meaning":"季，季节","explanation":"때：季，季节；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"7","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때로","audio":"/audio/47701a9685d9db782681.mp3"}},{"text":"미뤄야지","meaning":"拖延，推迟，拖后，延后","explanation":"미루다：拖延，推迟，拖后，延后；어야지：表达应当如此、决心或提醒，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"미루다","audio":"/audio/c56b12cde62f415abd7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15760","senseId":"1","lemma":"미루다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"미뤄야지","audio":"/audio/fed9276421febc85567d.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐.","meaning":"表示不用再多说什么，接受事实。","explanation":"뭐：表示不用再多说什么，接受事实。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27525","senseId":"3","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b5d87b0a7b5d6b82","term":"여행","zh":"旅行，旅游","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3","entryId":"28026","definition":"离开家，去其他地区或国外游玩的行为。","pronunciation":["여행"]},{"id":"ae